      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's what i thought. i noticed that my manager actually used to use emojis in our chats and now everything is super cold and strictly formal. and it's like i'm the only one who didn't get the memo about the new cafeteria schedule. it really feels like a systematic attempt to make me feel isolated. if i were to take this to a lawyer, what kind of specific 'intent' should i be looking to prove in these communications to show they're trying to cause a mental breakdown?",
